claim.claim-text:
a hot-side heat exchanger ("HHX") system (500);
a recuperator heat exchanger ("RHX") system (400);
a cold-side heat exchanger ("CHX") system (600);
a reversible powertrain system (801) comprising a first reversible turbomachine ("RTM") system (850) having a first RTM (850-1) and a second RTM (850-2), and a second RTM system (852) having a third RTM (852-1) and a fourth RTM (852-2), wherein first RTM system operates as a compressor system in a charge-mode configuration of the PHES system and operates as a turbine system in a generation-mode configuration of the PHES system, and wherein the second RTM system operates as a turbine system in the charge-mode configuration of the PHES system and operates as a compressor system in the generation-mode configuration of the PHES system; and
a working fluid loop (300C) comprising:
